 (with a calm clear state instead of hiding), a new lane [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]footer for `w`, a new links compass for `n`, a quiet review-due dot[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]on the selector's `s` letter, byte-compatible legacy fallbacks, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]updated docs, and a published Walker Footer glossary term.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]walker_footers.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/walker_footers.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-ky[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ky/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]nav api.walkMode v1 and the walk-mode doorbell[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]navapi[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]navapi: expose the persisted bracket-repeat mode through an additive nav[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]api namespace (current/select) plus a workspace doorbell event fired on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]mode change and once at setup; no visible change.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Ledger walker-footer host and the gated s panel[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]host[dim] · [dim][/dim]after navapi[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]host: route the existing ledger status item by walk mode, show the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]review footer only while s is selected with a Review-clear state and ]] [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]next hints, hide on w/n/unset for now, and keep a byte-compatible legacy[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fallback when the nav api is absent.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Lane footer for the w walk[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]lanes[dim] · [dim][/dim]after host[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]lanes: add the w panel as a pure view over api.laneWalk v2 queue counts [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](WIP/NEXT/READY with n/cap only when over, TODAY meter), with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]validated-row positions, lane answer hints, toast-matching clear states,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and a dash-parity test.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]nav links() and the links footer for the n walk[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]links[dim] · [dim][/dim]after lanes[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]links: add a read-only walkMode.links() preview built on nav's own [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prev/next matcher and an n panel destination compass with directional [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]arms, dashed create targets, generation-checked async, and a parity test[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]against openLabeledBodyLink.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Review attention dot on the selector's s[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]dot[dim] · [dim][/dim]after links[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]dot: ledger pushes a display-only attention value when review [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commitments are due off-s; nav paints a tiny tier-tinted dot on the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]selector's s letter with tooltip/aria counts, forced-colors support, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]no motion.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Visual previews, e2e, and placement[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]visual[dim] · 